# NOTE: the old `Design/Aurie3D/Scripts/charm*` wildcard hid seven real
# source files (charm_library/processor/profiles/on_aurie/contact_sheet/
# inspect + the hand-authored charm_inventory.csv). Charms are a live
# workstream now, so that tooling is tracked. Do not reintroduce a broad
# wildcard here — it silently hides future source.
Design/AurieCharmLibrary

